---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Terms | Airport Runways Live"
  description="Terms for the Airport Runways Live directory."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h1>Terms</h1>
      <p>
        This website is a directory. Listings are provided as-is. We do not guarantee that a stream is actually live,
        that a camera is pointed at a runway, or that a YouTube URL will remain valid.
      </p>
      <p>We can add, edit, or remove listings at any time, including featured flags.</p>
      <p>
        If you own a YouTube channel listed here, we will remove it when you ask. Use
        {' '}<a href="/remove">Remove my channel</a>. We may ask you to confirm ownership. That does not take the video
        off YouTube — only off this directory.
      </p>
      <p>
        Do not scrape YouTube through this site. Do not use our pages to restream someone else’s video. Watch on
        YouTube.
      </p>
      <p>English is the primary language of the site. A Spanish toggle is planned; it is not a second site.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
